rd mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.864em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.864em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>惯性权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 控探索（大则冲得远），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_1/c_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 调个体经验与社会经验的平衡。PSO 天生适合「梯度未知、只能采样评估」的源搜索（source seeking）。但经典 PSO 假设全局共享 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>，违背群体的局部信息原则；机器人版改用邻域最优（局部 PSO），只与通信邻居比较，落回 <a href=\"../coordination/distributed-coordination\">分布式协调机制</a> 的去中心化框架。在极简机器人上，邻域 PSO（NPSO）已被证明能克服 Kilobot 的噪声与短通信距离限制（<a href=\"https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/8479142\">NPSO for Kilobot, IEEE Xplore</a>）。2025 年的 PE-PSO 进一步加入持续探索与基于熵的自适应参数，用于动态无人机群的实时轨迹规划（<a href=\"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/rob.22466\">Swarm intelligence in action: PSO &amp; rendezvous, Wiley 2025</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从优化到覆盖-真实搜索任务\">从优化到覆盖：真实搜索任务</h2><p>觅食与搜索落地时，最常见的不是抽象优化而是区域覆盖（coverage）——保证一片区域的每个角落都被某台机器人感知到，常用于灾后搜救、农田巡查、环境监测。去中心化覆盖的主力是 Voronoi 划分与动态虚拟力：每台机器人负责离自己最近的 Voronoi 区域，向自己区域的「质心」移动，群体便自动把区域瓜分得均匀且无重叠；2025 年有工作用动态虚拟力做自组织覆盖，在通信受限时仍保持均匀（<a href=\"https://www.mdpi.com/2073-8994/17/8/1202\">Dynamic virtual force coverage, MDPI 2025</a>）。</p>\n<p>搜索任务的算法选择可总结如下，落地的应用场景见 <a href=\"../applications/applications-challenges\">应用与挑战</a>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务形态</th>\n<th>推荐范式</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路径/巡逻/遍历</td>\n<td>ACO</td>\n<td>信息素天然编码路径优劣</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续源搜索（信号/气味峰）</td>\n<td>局部 PSO</td>\n<td>采样驱动、无需梯度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区域全覆盖</td>\n<td>Voronoi + 虚拟力</td>\n<td>自动均匀瓜分、无重叠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>觅食与搜索的内核是探索-利用权衡，靠正反馈（招募）与负反馈（衰减）驱动的觅食循环。</li>\n<li>ACO 把蚁群间接通信数学化：信息素概率选路 + 挥发/沉积更新，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha,\\beta,\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 调探索-利用；擅长离散路径问题。</li>\n<li>PSO 适合连续空间源搜索：粒子融合惯性、自身最优、群体最优；机器人版用邻域最优以守住去中心化，2026 年加入持续探索与熵自适应。</li>\n<li>真实任务多是区域覆盖，去中心化主力是 Voronoi 划分 + 动态虚拟力，自动均匀瓜分。</li>\n<li>任务形态决定范式：路径用 ACO、连续源用局部 PSO、全覆盖用 Voronoi。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"觅食与搜索","id":"觅食与搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：探索-利用与觅食循环","id":"核心概念-探索-利用与觅食循环"},{"level":2,"text":"蚁群优化（ACO）：信息素路径搜索","id":"蚁群优化-aco-信息素路径搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"粒子群优化（PSO）：连续空间的群体搜索","id":"粒子群优化-pso-连续空间的群体搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"从优化到覆盖：真实搜索任务","id":"从优化到覆盖-真实搜索任务"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"聚集与编队","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/algorithms/aggregation-formation"},"next":{"title":"蜂拥与避碰","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/swarm-robotics/algorithms/flocking-collision-avoidance"}}